  <metadata>
    <name>Peaks of the Balkans – circular tour</name>
    <desc>The circular hiking trail in Prokletije National Park is 180.8 km long. With 9,342 m of total ascent and a highest point at 2,267 m above sea level, it is intended for experienced hikers. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
